# expect: reject PLN-11
# Same group rates as plan 05 but spread over 4 modules: the fourth heartbeat takes the load from
# 299700 bit/s of data frames to 300080 bit/s = 60.016 %. Catches ignoring heartbeats or a 512 kbit/s bus.
# CAN: heartbeat 4 B = 8*4+47+floor(65/4)=95 bit; data 8 B = 8*8+47+floor(97/4)=135 bit
# CAN: modules used 4 -> 4*95 = 380 bit/s; groups m1g0@1000, m2g1@1000, m3g2@200, m4g3@20
# CAN: sum of group rates 2220 Hz -> 2220*135 = 299700 bit/s; total 300080 bit/s = 60.016 % of 500 kbit/s (limit 300000)
# TLM: total sample rate 2220 Hz -> 22.2 samples per 10 ms frame -> 1 packet(s); 9*22.2 + 1*(22+4+66) = 291.8 B/frame * 100 * 8 = 233440 bit/s (limit 2000000)
iqk-plan 1
campaign blind1_c01
channel a_fast aam:1:0 rate=1000 range_mv=5000
channel b_fast aam:2:5 rate=1000 range_mv=5000
channel c_mid aam:3:6 rate=200 range_mv=5000
channel d_slow aam:4:9 rate=20 range_mv=5000
